{"4511140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unforgettable Love", "steam_appid": 4511140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4511160, 4511170, 4511180, 4511520, 4529880, 4529890, 4529900, 4529910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man (the player) wakes up with amnesia, remembering nothing about his past. Ingdao, believing she accidentally hit him while practicing driving, takes responsibility for bringing him to the hospital, giving him the temporary name “Pe Luem,” and letting him stay at her home. The only things he has with him are an empty phone and a job application for UPON Company. And so, his journey to recover his lost memories begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ing-Dao</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright and kind-hearted young woman who works freelance in voice recording, dubbing, and singing. She is the one who saved you and gave you the name “Pe Luem.” Behind her cheerful smile lies a dream left behind and a past that has yet to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I-Da</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly capable and dedicated HR manager who excels at her job, yet hides deep loneliness within. Trapped in a distorted relationship, she must face a truth that could change her life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e15b368f6a60836a6a33.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e15b368f6a60836a6a33.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e15b368f6a60836a6a33.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nene</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and seemingly clumsy intern who secretly possesses sharp intelligence and strong determination. She has infiltrated the company to uncover the truth and is willing to do whatever it takes to seek justice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/cb342845b6e10367212184af55e972ce.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/cb342845b6e10367212184af55e972ce.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/cb342845b6e10367212184af55e972ce.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Milin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardworking and determined café owner who takes on multiple jobs to achieve a single goal. She must earn 10 million before turning 30 to break free from a life she did not choose and take control of her own future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9270cc57ddc9c5a6811577d42af26002.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9270cc57ddc9c5a6811577d42af26002.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9270cc57ddc9c5a6811577d42af26002.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proud</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulous investment consultant who strives for perfection in everything she does. Beneath her flawless exterior lies pressure and a painful past, making it difficult for her to open up to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Fully Immersive First-Person Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience every moment through the eyes of the protagonist. Engage in conversations, make meaningful choices, and build relationships naturally in a fully first-person perspective that brings every moment to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Accessible Branching Storylines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a rich and diverse narrative with deeper story paths. Unlock hidden endings and special CGs through your choices and explore multiple relationship routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Realistic Performances with Cinematic Visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience natural acting paired with high-quality visuals. Every scene is crafted to deliver emotional depth and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Strategic Gameplay System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your experience by managing your finances through stock trading while uncovering lost memories. Plan your decisions carefully to influence story paths, discover hidden choices, and unlock key moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Stock Trading Currency System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your income through an in-game stock trading simulation. Analyze market trends, buy and sell strategically, and accumulate wealth. Use your earnings to unlock content, key scenes, and increase your chances of deepening relationships with each heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ High Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. With multiple branching paths, hidden choices, and different endings, each playthrough offers a fresh and unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Distinct and Memorable Heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cheerful girl hiding emotional scars, to a capable yet emotionally vulnerable career woman, to a lively intern with a hidden agenda, each heroine has her own story and relationship path, waiting for you to shape.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man (the player) wakes up with amnesia, remembering nothing about his past. Ingdao, believing she accidentally hit him while practicing driving, takes responsibility for bringing him to the hospital, giving him the temporary name “Pe Luem,” and letting him stay at her home. The only things he has with him are an empty phone and a job application for UPON Company. And so, his journey to recover his lost memories begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ing-Dao</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright and kind-hearted young woman who works freelance in voice recording, dubbing, and singing. She is the one who saved you and gave you the name “Pe Luem.” Behind her cheerful smile lies a dream left behind and a past that has yet to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/9e0adbefcbc8330e2ceb26c02a111b9a.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>I-Da</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly capable and dedicated HR manager who excels at her job, yet hides deep loneliness within. Trapped in a distorted relationship, she must face a truth that could change her life forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e15b368f6a60836a6a33.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e15b368f6a60836a6a33.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/5d29baa64fd4e