ud</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meticulous investment consultant who strives for perfection in everything she does. Beneath her flawless exterior lies pressure and a painful past, making it difficult for her to open up to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.poster.avif?t=1784103683\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.webm?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/extras/b815b50cfd00c241d8baaf54373bcc43.mp4?t=1784103683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Fully Immersive First-Person Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience every moment through the eyes of the protagonist. Engage in conversations, make meaningful choices, and build relationships naturally in a fully first-person perspective that brings every moment to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Accessible Branching Storylines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a rich and diverse narrative with deeper story paths. Unlock hidden endings and special CGs through your choices and explore multiple relationship routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Realistic Performances with Cinematic Visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience natural acting paired with high-quality visuals. Every scene is crafted to deliver emotional depth and realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Strategic Gameplay System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your experience by managing your finances through stock trading while uncovering lost memories. Plan your decisions carefully to influence story paths, discover hidden choices, and unlock key moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Stock Trading Currency System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your income through an in-game stock trading simulation. Analyze market trends, buy and sell strategically, and accumulate wealth. Use your earnings to unlock content, key scenes, and increase your chances of deepening relationships with each heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ High Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. With multiple branching paths, hidden choices, and different endings, each playthrough offers a fresh and unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Distinct and Memorable Heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cheerful girl hiding emotional scars, to a capable yet emotionally vulnerable career woman, to a lively intern with a hidden agenda, each heroine has her own story and relationship path, waiting for you to shape.</p>", "short_description": "You survived a drowning accident but lost all your memories. As “Pe Luem,” you must slowly piece together your past. Along the way, you will meet five women with their own dreams and secrets. Build relationships and uncover the truth, Who is the one that still remains in your memory?", "supported_languages": "English, Thai<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/a9c095f938d24f6612e9078305ab8dc0d2848f69/header.jpg?t=1784103683", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511140/1f6f1010f5a102900650b3dcb43fa81bfdc06f29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178